From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <a@b>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 05:04:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Screensaver: the park gallery in the plugin API

A shared gallery module (interface/Gallery) takes the Load window's
gallery folders and preview renders, and keeps an index of the gallery's
parks: name, map size and date read in the background and cached in the
cache folder's gallery-index.json, so only new and changed files are read
again. The screensaver global gets gallery (version, folders, entries,
addFolder, removeFolder, requestPictures, refresh), addPark(sequence,
paths) and newPlaylist({ paths }) for parks picked there (only parks in
the gallery's index; the generator gets them in a list file), and paused,
which holds the title screen still while the mode's editor renders
previews. Overlay images that are not there yet are looked for again.
